### Cosmos Learning - API Sample Requests
### ============================================================
###
### Purpose:
###   End-to-end HTTP examples for the current learning project.
###
### Recommended order:
###   1. Basic Product CRUD
###   2. Structured product query
###   3. Pagination / continuation tokens
###   4. Error handling
###   5. Global exception handling
###   6. Vector search + Ollama embeddings
###   7. Large vector-search catalog
###   8. Hybrid search
###   9. Hybrid search modes
###  10. Weighted RRF
###  11. Metadata filtering
###  12. Ranking diagnostics
###
### Prerequisites:
###   - Cosmos DB vNext Emulator running
###   - API running
###   - Ollama running for vector/hybrid scenarios
###   - mxbai-embed-large installed for vector/hybrid scenarios
###
### Current local API:
###   http://localhost:5142
###
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:5142

@productId = product-demo-001
@category = Electronics

###
### ============================================================
### 01 - BASIC CRUD
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 01.1 Create a product
### ------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{productId}}",
  "productName": "Demo wireless headphones",
  "description": "A product created through the CRUD API.",
  "category": "{{category}}",
  "subCategory": "Audio",
  "status": "Active",
  "price": 129.99,
  "discount": 10.00,
  "rating": 4.5,
  "stockQuantity": 25,
  "isActive": true,
  "isFeatured": false,
  "isAvailable": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
  "availableFrom": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
  "warrantyDetails": "1 year limited warranty",
  "tags": [
    "wireless",
    "audio"
  ],
  "supportedCountries": [
    "United States",
    "Canada"
  ],
  "relatedProducts": [],
  "manufacturer": {
    "name": "Contoso Audio",
    "country": "United States",
    "website": "https://example.com"
  },
  "warehouseLocation": {
    "country": "United States",
    "state": "WA",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "postalCode": "98101"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "source": "manual-entry",
    "version": "v1.0",
    "importedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "audit": {
    "createdBy": "sample-request",
    "updatedBy": null
  },
  "reviews": []
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 01.2 List products
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/products
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 01.3 Point read
###     Both id and partition key/category are required.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/products/{{productId}}?category={{category}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 01.4 Replace a product
### ------------------------------------------------------------

PUT {{host}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{productId}}",
  "productName": "Updated demo wireless headphones",
  "description": "The complete replacement document.",
  "category": "{{category}}",
  "subCategory": "Audio",
  "status": "Active",
  "price": 119.99,
  "discount": 15.00,
  "rating": 4.6,
  "stockQuantity": 30,
  "isActive": true,
  "isFeatured": true,
  "isAvailable": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-05T01:00:00Z",
  "availableFrom": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z",
  "warrantyDetails": "2 year limited warranty",
  "tags": [
    "wireless",
    "audio",
    "featured"
  ],
  "supportedCountries": [
    "United States",
    "Canada"
  ],
  "relatedProducts": [],
  "manufacturer": {
    "name": "Contoso Audio",
    "country": "United States",
    "website": "https://example.com"
  },
  "warehouseLocation": {
    "country": "United States",
    "state": "WA",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "postalCode": "98101"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "source": "sample-request",
    "version": "v1.1",
    "importedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "audit": {
    "createdBy": "sample-request",
    "updatedBy": "sample-request"
  },
  "reviews": []
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 01.5 Delete a product
### ------------------------------------------------------------

DELETE {{host}}/products/{{productId}}?category={{category}}

###
### ============================================================
### 02 - ACTUAL HTTP QUERY METHOD
### ============================================================
###
### This is a literal HTTP QUERY request, not POST /query.
### The endpoint accepts structured JSON filters and builds a
### parameterized Cosmos DB query.
###
### Supported concepts demonstrated below include:
###   - category
###   - price range
###   - date range
###   - IS_NULL
###   - IS_DEFINED
###   - nested objects
###   - arrays / ARRAY_CONTAINS
###   - EXISTS over nested reviews
###   - sorting
###   - pagination
###
### ============================================================
Accept: application/json

{
  "manufacturerCountry": "United States",
  "metadataSource": "catalog-import",
  "city": "Seattle",
  "pageSize": 10
}

###
### ============================================================
### 03 - CONTINUATION-TOKEN PAGINATION
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 03.1 First page
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/products/pages?pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 03.2 Continuation-token demo - Page 1
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/products/pages?pageSize=1
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 03.3 Continuation-token demo - Page 2
###
### IMPORTANT:
### Replace the token below with the continuationToken returned
### by the previous response if your current data produces a
### different token.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/products/pages?pageSize=5
Accept: application/json
x-continuation-token: [{"compositeToken":{"token":null,"range":{"min":"","max":"FF"}},"resumeValues":["product-00001"],"rid":"AgAAAIIAAADpAwAAfwQAAAAAAAA=","skipCount":1}]

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 03.4 Continuation-token demo - Page 3
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{host}}/products/pages?pageSize=1
Accept: application/json
x-continuation-token: [{"compositeToken":{"token":null,"range":{"min":"","max":"FF"}},"resumeValues":["product-00006"],"rid":"AgAAAIIAAADuAwAAvQQAAAAAAAA=","skipCount":1}]

